---
<BaseLayout title="Experience | Bhagyashri Patil">
<header class="page-intro">
  <span class="eyebrow">Experience / Product &amp; solutions engineering</span>
  <h1>Customer-first thinking.<br/><span class="accent">Engineered for impact.</span></h1>
  <p>From enterprise analytics to data products, cloud architecture, and applied AI, my work has centered on turning complex business needs into systems that are faster, more reliable, and easier to use.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="#career">Explore my experience ↘</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bhagyashripatil/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn profile ↗</a></div>
</header>
<section class="section" id="career" aria-labelledby="career-title">
  <div class="section-row">
    <span class="eyebrow">01 / Career journey</span>
    <div><h2 id="career-title">Building products, platforms, and better decisions.</h2><p>Five roles across automotive intelligence, AI recruitment, healthcare, consulting, and industrial analytics. Below are selected contributions and outcomes from my professional experience.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="timeline">
    {positions.map((job,i)=><article class="role-card">
      <div class="role-side"><span class="role-index">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="role-date">{job.dates}</span><span class="role-location">{job.location}</span></div>
      <div class="role-detail">
        <span class="eyebrow">{job.domain}</span>
        <h3>{job.company}</h3>
        {job.brand && <span class="company-brand">{job.brand}</span>}
        <p class="role-title">{job.role}</p>
        <div class="outcomes">{job.highlights.map(item=><span>{item}</span>)}</div>
        {job.engagements
          ? <div class="client-engagements">
              {job.engagements.map(engagement=><section class="client-engagement" aria-label={`Client project: ${engagement.client}`}>
                <div class="client-heading"><span class="client-label">Client engagement</span><h4>{engagement.client}</h4>{engagement.previous && <span class="client-previous">({engagement.previous})</span>}<span class="client-sector">{engagement.sector}</span></div>
                <ul class="achievements">{engagement.bullets.map(bullet=><li>{bullet}</li>)}</ul>
              </section>)}
            </div>
          : <ul class="achievements">{job.bullets.map(bullet=><li>{bullet}</li>)}</ul>}
      </div>
    </article>)}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Connecting the dots</span><div><h2>A toolkit, not a boundary.</h2><p>My experience connects requirements discovery, product analytics, data engineering, modeling, cloud architecture, and machine learning. I'm applying that foundation to increasingly product-led and AI-enabled solutions.</p><div class="chips"><span>Product analytics</span><span>Solutions engineering</span><span>Databricks &amp; Spark</span><span>Python &amp; NLP</span><span>SQL &amp; ETL</span><span>Cloud lakehouse architecture</span><span>Data visualization</span><span>Stakeholder collaboration</span></div></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">03 / What's next</span><div><h2>Product-minded solutions for new domains.</h2><p>I'm exploring product management and solutions engineering opportunities in Boston, Massachusetts, or remote, where I can combine product thinking, architecture, enterprise data experience, and applied AI.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/projects/">Explore my work ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="/">Back to About →</a></div></div></div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.accent{color:#4e5b6c}
.timeline{margin-top:42px;border-top:1px solid #dfe7f0}
.role-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(165px,.28fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(24px,5vw,80px);padding:clamp(30px,4vw,57px) 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe7f0}
.role-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px}
.role-index{font:800 1.4rem Manrope,sans-serif;color:#4e5b6c;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.role-date{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:800;color:#243750;margin-top:9px}
.role-location{font-size:.9rem;color:#7b889c}
.role-detail{max-width:1050px;min-width:0}
.role-detail h3{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,2.5vw,2.15rem);line-height:1.24;margin:14px 0 5px}
.company-brand{font-size:.92rem;color:#6b7990;font-weight:600}
.role-title{margin:8px 0 18px;color:#253852;font-size:1rem;font-weight:800}
.outcomes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:18px 0 23px}
.outcomes span{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #d4d6d5;background:transparent;color:#4c5968;padding:5px 0;border-radius:0;font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem}
.achievements{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:13px}
.achievements li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:#56677d;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.75}
.achievements li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:12px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#7290dd}
.client-engagements{display:grid;gap:24px;margin-top:26px}
.client-engagement{border-left:2px solid #e2e9f6;padding-left:18px}
.client-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px 10px;margin:0 0 13px}
.client-label{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71839e;font-weight:800;width:100%}
.client-heading h4{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:1.07rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.35;margin:0;color:#243750}
.client-previous{font-size:.83rem;color:#75849a}
.client-sector{font-size:.8rem;color:#7383a0;font-weight:650}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:24px}
.chips span{padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e0e8f3;border-radius:999px;font-size:.86rem;color:#52647d;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:800px){.role-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.role-side{display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.role-date{margin-top:0}}
</style>
